{
  "name": "Driver Incident Report",
  "version": "1.1",
  "description": "Driver submits a field incident (accident, cargo damage, theft). Ops assessment and finance estimate run in parallel; the case is summarised and closed only after both are done. Exercises: parallel fork/join, timer escalation. Escalation follows D-ESC: timer -> higher role -> fail closed (ISS-1007 / Q-989; BA ruling GH #2281). ops-assessment (role-ops-manager, P1D) -> escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo (role-ceo, P1D) -> stalled: ops-auto-close notice; finance-estimate (role-accountant, P1D) -> escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo (role-ceo, P1D) -> stalled: finance-auto-close notice. A stalled branch never marks the incident assessed or costed; it rejoins parallel-join through its notice node. The injury gate defaults toward more scrutiny: an absent or unrecognised injury_involved value takes the safety notification. v1.1 (GH #2933) drops the v1.0 ops-escalation-timer TIMER branch (e12/e13): it fed parallel-join, so the AND-join waited a full P1D even when both tasks completed; ops-assessment already carries its own escalation timer. QA deployment payload (ISS-1022 / Q-1004, GH #2294); the simulation copy is test/fixtures/simulation/swiftroute/process_shipment_dispatch.yaml and the two are kept in step by test/letflow/scripts/swiftroute_incident_qa_fixture_test.exs.",
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "node_type": "START"
      },
      {
        "id": "injury-check",
        "node_type": "EXCLUSIVE_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "injury-check-merge",
        "node_type": "EXCLUSIVE_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "safety-notification",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/webhooks/safety-alert",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "parallel-fork",
        "node_type": "PARALLEL_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "ops-assessment",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-ops-manager",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-ceo",
          "description": "top of chain: escalation_role is nominal; stalled = fail closed",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "finance-estimate",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-accountant",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-ceo",
          "description": "top of chain: escalation_role is nominal; stalled = fail closed",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ops-auto-close",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/internal/incidents/{{variables.incident_id}}/ops-timeout",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "finance-auto-close",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/internal/incidents/{{variables.incident_id}}/finance-timeout",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "parallel-join",
        "node_type": "PARALLEL_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "case-summary",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/internal/incidents/{{variables.incident_id}}/close",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "end",
        "node_type": "END"
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
